  "description": "AWS SDK for .NET V3 reached end of support on June 1st, 2026, and no longer receives updates, including security fixes. See https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdk-for-net/v4/developer-guide/net-dg-v4.html for migration guidance. AWS Transfer for SFTP is a fully managed service that enables transfer of secure data over the internet into and out of Amazon S3. SFTP is deeply embedded in data exchange workflows across different industries such as financial services, healthcare, advertising, and retail, among others.",
